To achieve this, you can use a combination of HTML, CSS, and React (if you're using a React-based framework). Here's a simplified example:

1. First, create your SVG icon:

```xml
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
